  "details": {
   "description": "Complan is a ‘Dairy-based Beverage Mix’, a Nutrition drink powder scientifically designed to meet the nutritional needs of growing children. Its Creamy Classic Flavour is a nutritious drink with a delicious taste that your kid will enjoy. It provides essential nutrients, including 100% milk protein, vital for their development. Complan contains 63% more protein (per 100g and per serve basis), than regular Malt-based Food Drink powder. Its formulation with 34 key nutrients, such as Vitamin D2, calcium, Zinc etc., is designed to support overall growth and functioning.\nComplan is clinically proven to support 2X faster growth and supports memory and concentration. This nutrition drink for kids contains essential nutrients like iodine, iron, zinc etc., that are known to support brain development and functioning. The pro-immunity nutrients like Vitamin A, Vitamin C etc., support immune function. Serve this delight twice a day (33g x 2) as a part of your child’s balanced diet. It can be served in two delicious ways, both as a hot drink and a cold drink. Give your child the Complan nutrition.",
